<title>THAILAND: Hemaraj Land 1996 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Hemaraj Land 1996 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		8.50	vs	     7.92</p>
<p>    Net		     601.47	vs	   560.81</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Hemaraj Land and Development Plc, a property developer.</p>
